    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Psychic levels cap how many **psychic abilities** each **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** **PSYKER** unit with this ability can use:\n\n- The unit's abilities state its **psyker level**, which is 1 or more.\n- A **psychic ability**'s name states its **psychic level**, also 1 or more.\n- In each battle round, a unit of yours may use any mix of **psychic abilities** whose combined **psychic level** is at most its **psyker level**.",
